  "name": "Family Office Knowledge Graph",
  "description": "One record per family office, drawn from the public record: the GLEIF spine first, then the national registers that fill and confirm it. Every field carries where it came from, who read it, when, and its state. Read-only, session-free, typed errors. Nodes: United Arab Emirates (ae-fo-kg), Australia (au-fo-kg), Canada (ca-fo-kg), Switzerland (ch-fo-kg), Germany (de-fo-kg), Denmark (dk-fo-kg), Spain (es-fo-kg), France (fr-fo-kg), Italy (it-fo-kg), Luxembourg (lu-fo-kg), Netherlands (nl-fo-kg), Norway (no-fo-kg), Rest of world (row-fo-kg), Singapore (sg-fo-kg), United Kingdom (uk-fo-kg), United States (us-fo-kg).",
